{"about_the_game":"<strong><u>Features</u><br><br>- Design your own attacks<br>- Explore new party builds every dungeon<br>- Infinite dungeons<br>- Easy to use, difficult to master</strong><br><br><u>Overview</u><br><br>Gameplay is a mix of turn-based dungeon crawling and 'deck building inspired' elements.<br>Basically, it has the feeling of Slay The Spire, but it is NOT a card game.<br>A re-invented equipment system lets the player experience the thrill of growing more and more powerful every time they play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061990/extras/1cd157b532464e96a350889eaef679be.poster.avif?t=1739200318\" width=166 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061990/extras/1cd157b532464e96a350889eaef679be.webm?t=1739200318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061990/extras/1cd157b532464e96a350889eaef679be.mp4?t=1739200318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061990/extras/12e44e979433b42f51e6d88e5d70e4d9.poster.avif?t=1739200318\" width=116 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061990/extras/12e44e979433b42f51e6d88e5d70e4d9.webm?t=1739200318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061990/extras/12e44e979433b42f51e6d88e5d70e4d9.mp4?t=1739200318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061990/extras/923e8d3f31e2fed00a90b429c24dc90b.poster.avif?t=1739200318\" wi